Haakon Studebaker <heptapod@gmail.com> writes:
> So how did the monk class start out in Nethack? Did someone propose a YANI? 
> Was there a homebrew patch that gained popularity and the DevTeam decided 
> to include it with vanilla? Was it something created entirely by the 
> DevTeam?

The Monk, though it had been something of a recurring YANI for some
years beforehand, made its first appearance in Stephen White's NH+
variant in 1994; from there it was incorporated into SLASH, and hence
SLASH'EM. The vanilla DevTeam appropriated SLASH'EM's Monk, with
considerable changes, in 3.3.0.

